od girl.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She studies English literature in college, and therefore can speak English quite well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unfortunately, her cooking is awful. They say one bite of her food can induce unconsciousness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems to enjoy smoothing the constantly-ruffled feathers of her outspoken little sister, Akira."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1718"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a4814966b4c4530eb43b3c070e0f1d3b7a7f1912371fc8cc838d2e1e0c9ba88.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2308b2f22f0b13220f585d6bda4c0b8699a0f765ef7d3a6e4ff62ac0b4715f40.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1719","characterName":"御崎 陽輝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1719"},"originalCharacterName":"御崎 陽輝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"906"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akira is so bad at English that even when she speaks it, the listener assumes she's speaking Japanese."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike Makoto, she's a skilled cook, and cooks for the protagonist every night during his stay."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's so awkward that even when she's feeling happy, she tends to express it as anger. Still, she's a spunky girl unafraid to voice her opinions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She tends to act sull